The '''Rock Pet''' is a [[Pets|Mining Mount]] that drops directly from {{skill|Mining}}. Unlike most pets, the '''Rock Pet''' is obtained via Mining milestones, similar to the {{Item|Dolphin Pet}}. Upon reaching a milestone, a new '''Rock Pet''' is acquired, any previous '''Rock Pets''' are not upgraded.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Rock Pet''' is obtained by reaching {{skill|Mining}} milestones. The milestones are as follows:

Note: To obtain the pet, players must mine a certain amount of [[Ores]], [[Dwarven Metals]] or [[Gemstones]].

{| class="wikitable"
! Rarity !! Ores Mined
|-
| {{Common}} || 2,500
|-
| {{Uncommon}} || 7,500
|-
| {{Rare}} || 20,000
|-
| {{Epic}} || 100,000
|-
| {{Legendary}} || 250,000
|}

If lost, the player can repurchase the highest rarity they have unlocked from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}}.

