== Tips ==
*It is not recommended to upgrade this pet at {{NPCSprite|Kat}}, especially to {{Legendary}} rarity, since it is very expensive and unnecessary.
*This pet is great for early game [[Enderman Slayer]], as it gives a massive amount of survivability while riding on it. 

== Trivia ==
* Players used to have to use the [[SkyBlock API]] to see their milestone progress. However, this has been changed in SkyBlock Update [https://hypixel.net/threads/skyblock-0-11-4.4145813/ 0.11.4], allowing the player to check the milestone progress in-game through the specific pet's appropriate skill menu once they have reached the first milestone.
* While riding the Rock Pet, the player takes no {{stat|kb}}. This can be useful for [[Slayer]] quests and the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]] event.
* When sneaking at the edge of a block, the Rock Pet will fall down. Jumping after it and right-clicking it mid-air makes the player sit in the air not moving as the Rock Pet glitches away (it just falls down slowly now when you're on it instead of floating in the air).
* The Rock Pet is the first pet to have more than one skin in a [[Fire Sale]].
* There has been a bug involving using the Rock Pet and right clicking with an item with an item ability. This would cause the player to be bugged and be able to walk around, break blocks, and place blocks, all while still being on the rock pet on other player's screens. However, this appears to just be a visual bug, as other players still see the player on the rock pet. This bug was shown in a [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=suJGKLp4mfk Dragonhanx YouTube video.]
* Using {{NPCSprite|Kat}} to upgrade a Rock Pet means that, when you reach a milestone, you end up with another Rock Pet, meaning you could potentially end up with {{Green|5}} {{Legendary}} Rock Pets. The amount of effort, time and money required to obtain {{Green|5}} {{Legendary}} Rock Pets is prohibitive, and is not recommended, as it doesn't give you additional [[Pet Score]].

